Oxbeat-beats licensing
=======================

The build scripts, recipes and workflow files in this repository are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The sounds themselves are NOT covered by this file. Each pack is built from
an upstream sample library and keeps that library's own licence, which is
named in its recipe (packs/<id>.json), in the pack's pack.json, and in the
table in README.md. Where the upstream library ships a licence file, the
pack includes it.
